{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226954","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226954","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1422695401:0":{"text":"드레이아, 이제 끝입니다. 은혜의 이슬을 어디서 구한 것입니까?","source_cn":"谎言止步于此，德莱雅。灵露从何而来？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x545B0A5D74B60501","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422695402:0":{"text":"묵비권을 행사하겠습니다.","source_cn":"哼！我不会告诉你的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5A27100680B7910","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422695403:0":{"text":"그렇게 입을 다문다고 넘어갈 수 있을 것 같습니까?","source_cn":"你以为嘴硬可以扛过去吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7EA6EAF695ADA6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422695404:0":{"text":"제 굳건한 신앙을 위해 죽어도 말할 수 없습니다.","source_cn":"我的信仰坚定，宁死也不会背叛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF82A8740F95708D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422695405:0":{"text":"죽어도? 누가 당신을 죽인다고 했습니까? 사리에 님은 온갖 방법을 동원해 그 입을 열면 열었지, 절대 죽게 두진 않을 겁니다.","source_cn":"死？谁说要你死了？沙利叶有一千种方法让你开口，却不会给...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25160FAABFF4BDFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422695406:0":{"text":"사리에... 그럴 리가! 허풍은 집어치우시지요!","source_cn":"沙利叶……他才不会！你在虚张声势！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12A2D791E498CBF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422695407:0":{"text":"사리에 님이 누구의 아들인지 잊으셨습니까? 그래도 끝까지 해보시겠다는 건가요?","source_cn":"你真的想试试？别忘了他是谁的儿子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AC9AA56078F2DB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422695408:0":{"text":"여왕... 여왕님... 그만, 말씀드리겠습니다.","source_cn":"女王……女王陛下……够了，我说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6286B74576387BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1422695409:0":{"text":"튜더 님이 계시는... 지하에 있는 <style=\"highlight\">불길의 동굴</style>에서...","source_cn":"是都铎大人……他在地底的<style=highligh...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7708CFC6EF48412","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1422695409":{"text":"튜더 님이 계시는... 지하에 있는 <style=\"highlight\">불길의 동굴</style>에서...","source_cn":"是都铎大人……他在地底的<style=highlight>烈焰岩窟</style>……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7708CFC6EF48412","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1422695410:0":{"text":"드래곤이 떠난 후 튜더도 함께 사라졌었는데, 계속 어딘가에 숨어 있던 모양입니다.","source_cn":"龙飞走后，都铎就不见了。他应该一直藏在暗处。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB680BA47A4BD69B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1422695411:0":{"text":"드레이아를 데려갈 사람을 부르겠습니다. 저희는 튜더를 찾으러 가지요.","source_cn":"我叫人把德莱雅带走，然后我们直接去找都铎。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B7ECEFFA8854F90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1422695411":{"text":"드레이아를 데려갈 사람을 부르겠습니다. 저희는 튜더를 찾으러 가지요.","source_cn":"我叫人把德莱雅带走，然后我们直接去找都铎。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B7ECEFFA8854F90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1422695412:0":{"text":"사리에 님께 배운 겁니다. 지금까지는 잘 먹히는군요.","source_cn":"我跟沙利叶学的，目前来看成效尚可。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x130A263CEA84168E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1422695413:0":{"text":"사리에 님은 나사레스의 예리함을 이어받았지만, 직접 드러내지 않습니다.","source_cn":"沙利叶继承了奈萨雷斯的敏锐，却不像她那样直接展示力量。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52288C661612094B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1422695414:0":{"text":"대신 미소와 가벼운 대화로 상대의 경계를 풀고, 마지막에 결정타를 날리는 것을 즐기지요.","source_cn":"他更喜欢用微笑和闲谈让对手放松警惕，然后一击必中。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAFDC21EC7AEBE8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1422695415:0":{"text":"사리에 님도 역시 보통이 아니시군요.","source_cn":"听起来沙利叶很有手段。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08006BA66669D25F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1422695416:0":{"text":"사리에 님은 저희가 생각하는 것보다 훨씬 복잡한 분입니다. 어머니의 그림자 아래에서 자랐지만 정반대의 길을 선택했지요...","source_cn":"沙利叶比任何人想象的都要复杂。他在他母亲的阴影之下，却...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB4356AD57416ACA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1422695417:0":{"text":"하지만 지금은 사리에 님 이야기를 할 때가 아닙니다. 튜더를 찾으러 가야 해요.","source_cn":"不过，现在不是讨论沙利叶的时候，我们得去会一会都铎了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x417C94D847A36DC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:0:1":{"text":"못된 걸 배웠네","source_cn":"你变坏了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3BA21F4D08C05A10","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"못된 걸 배웠네","female":"못된 걸 배웠네","variant_male_record_index":"73516","variant_female_record_index":"73517","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choi